{"id":3242,"name":"Yumekui Merry","slug":"yumekui_merry","synopsis":"Sometimes daydreaming can get you into trouble, but what do you do when it's other people's dreams that you have to watch out for? Yumeji Fujiwara has the unique ability to predict what kind of dreams other people will have, but lately, his own dreams have taken a bizarre turn in which he's being pursued by armies of cats. Stranger yet, Yumeji learns that the leader of the dream cats needs his body to access the Real World. \n\n\r\nFinally, the strange becomes downright weird when a beautiful girl suddenly drops on top of him and announces that she's a Dream Demon looking for a way back to the Dream World! The fabric that separates reality and fantasy is torn to shreds, and Yumeji has a lot of sleepless nights ahead of him as he has to deal with both the dream stalking and a dream walking! \n\n\r\n(Source: Sentai Filmworks)","format":"TV","season":"WINTER","year":2011,"createdAt":"2021-03-27 00:44:51","updatedAt":"2021-03-28 09:44:02","resources":{"nodes":[{"site":"MAL","externalId":9331},{"site":"ANILIST","externalId":9331},{"site":"KITSU","externalId":5679},{"site":"ANIDB","externalId":7725},{"site":"ANN","externalId":11765},{"site":"ANIME_PLANET","externalId":3476},{"site":"HIDIVE","externalId":null}]},"images":{"nodes":[{"id":6469,"facet":"LARGE_COVER","path":"anime/large-cover/60EOq59x3u7mzvi7qksnfnbNLKfaBS16srNp1Kyd.jpg"},{"id":6470,"facet":"SMALL_COVER","path":"anime/small-cover/8mo1XbhowToDosjS519R7yS1QfUDrmmDBKhYOIAJ.avif"}]},"studios":{"nodes":[{"id":34,"name":"J.C.Staff","slug":"jcstaff"}]},"series":{"nodes":[]},"animethemes":[{"id":4426,"slug":"OP1","type":"OP","sequence":null,"song":{"id":4426,"title":"Daydream Syndrome","titleNative":null},"animethemeentries":[{"id":5053,"version":1,"episodes":null,"nsfw":false,"spoiler":false,"videos":{"nodes":[{"id":3881,"basename":"YumekuiMerry-OP1.webm","filename":"YumekuiMerry-OP1","link":"https://v.animethemes.moe/YumekuiMerry-OP1.webm","mimetyp